I'm trying to follow the rules of [[Semantic Versioning|https://semver.org/]].

!! 0.1.0

* Add [[giscus|https://giscus.app/]] (~GitHub Discussions) as the recommended service. utterances is still supported and stays in use until the giscus fields are filled in, so existing wikis keep working after the update
* Add the service setting (automatic, giscus or utterances)
* Replace the DOM handling of the macro with the `<$github-comments>` widget. The thread no longer reloads while the tiddler body is edited, and titles with quotes no longer break it
* Add the `github-comments-term` field to keep a thread after renaming a tiddler
* Translate common theme names between the two services

!! 0.0.1

* First public release
